Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.33,0:01:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五年前 一个科学实验出了事故 带来高智慧猿猴物种的崛起…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,期间由猿猴流感衍生出的病毒 几乎摧毁了整个人类族群
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.97,0:01:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭借凯撒的统领 新猿猴文明黎明初现 人类种族的幸存者只能奋力挣扎以求共存…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但因猿族叛徒科巴向人类展开复仇袭击 最终引发了战争
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.03,0:01:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类向北面军事基地内集结的残余美国陆军发出紧急求救
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.00,0:01:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷酷的特种部队上校和他的勇猛营士兵们受令去歼灭猿猴族
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,传言指出凯撒在逃避追捕的近二年间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:02:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,身处于丛林中的秘密指挥基地组编战斗 随着战争的肆虐…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:07.64,Title,0,0,0,0,,《猩球崛起3：终极之战》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.87,0:02:13.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（猿猴杀手）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:20.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（该闭眼了 猴崽子）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.45,0:02:27.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（濒危物种）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.74,0:03:28.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（驴子）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.88,0:48:34.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（塞拉动物园）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.93,0:50:04.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加利福尼亚边境 隔离设施 塔岩礁）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.45,0:51:47.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（诺娃 雪佛兰 新星）
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.37,1:16:48.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（历史）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.23,1:27:50.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（此路 可逃出生天）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.55,1:28:32.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（猿灾泛滥）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.43,1:40:27.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（驴子）
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.27,1:46:15.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（把恐惧留给自己 和他人分享勇气）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:02:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.97,0:03:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是条战壕吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a trench?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.47,0:03:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来里面好像还有更多的猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like there's more of them inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,回声 2-6 呼叫总部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Echo 2-6 to command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 我们在树林北部发现三只猿类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, we've got eyes on three Kong in the north woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只持有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them is armed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.65,0:03:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子刚发现了另一个战壕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our donkey just spotted another trench.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.19,0:03:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的大本营可能就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the base is near.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.94,0:04:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.66,0:04:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解 长官 通话结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, copy. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 驴子过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, donkey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.21,0:04:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,普里彻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preacher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.51,0:04:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞定那只有枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one with the gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他击倒它 你们就马上把战壕轰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as the gunner's down, you guys take out the trench.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.31,0:04:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.41,0:04:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,装弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reload!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快撤！快撤！ 快撤！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back! Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.54,0:07:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 你听得到吗 上校？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, do you copy? Colonel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.88,0:07:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是普里彻 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preacher, sir! It's Preacher!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.38,0:07:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里？快告诉我你的坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you, soldier? I need your position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.51,0:07:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 你能看见什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know! - What do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.89,0:07:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也看不见 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see anything, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.43,0:07:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们损失惨重 小队长也阵亡了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost a lot of men, and the captain is dead, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 冷静 现在由你来指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, calm down. You're in command now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.39,0:08:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吗 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.85,0:08:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这只有我一个人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's just me all by myself now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.73,0:08:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.23,0:08:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 我大概没有活路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, I don't think I'm gonna make it, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 那你能杀多少就杀多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. You kill as many as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,阵亡63人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixty-three dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是凯撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Caesar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.79,0:09:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找你找得好苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been searching for you for so long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.63,0:09:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听说你有个隐蔽的指挥所\N{\fnArial\fs30}We heard you had a hidden command base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们就是找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we could never find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.51,0:09:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当中有些人 觉得你可能已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us started to think that you might be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.97,0:10:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但麦卡洛上校说你没死 而是藏在某处\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Colonel McCullough said you were out here somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.97,0:10:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要杀就痛快点 - 闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just kill us already. - Shut up, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？它们就是一群畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? They're animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会宰了我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna slaughter us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.73,0:10:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场战争不是我挑起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not start this war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪魁祸首已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ape who did is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫科巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was Koba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.04,0:10:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经处决了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.54,0:10:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今我只为保护猿族而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I fight only… to protect apes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.01,0:10:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有十多个那样的猿族\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got 10 more just like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.02,0:10:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know these apes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.89,0:10:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,科巴的亲信\N{\fnArial\fs30}They follow Koba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们曾想杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tried to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.07,0:10:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们害怕我的惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}They fear what I will do to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.40,0:11:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 现在他们跟着你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now, they serve you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.07,0:11:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是为了活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't fear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.42,0:11:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才应该害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.21,0:11:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你们还能在森林里藏多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you think woods can protect you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.43,0:11:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类能毁了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans destroy you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.43,0:11:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校拥有至高无上的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their Kerna has all power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这些人来说 他可不是个普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For them, he more than just human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.73,0:11:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是神\N{\fnArial\fs30}He everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.57,0:11:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 先杀了凯撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He say: first Caesar die…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再让所有猴子给他陪葬\N{\fnArial\fs30}then all of you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.33,0:11:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,温特 把这个叛徒带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winter! Take this traitor outside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.01,0:12:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么处理这些人类？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should we do with the humans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.61,0:12:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要放我们走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're letting us go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.78,0:12:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉这位上校 你们见到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your Colonel you have seen me now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.82,0:12:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我传个话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have a message for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他把森林留给我们 一切杀戮就可以结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us the woods, and the killing can stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们会传话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think they will give him the message?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.18,0:12:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们本身就传达了我的意思 毛里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are the message, Maurice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.39,0:12:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会明白我们并不是什么野蛮动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will see we are not savages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.07,0:13:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个叛徒攻击了我！他跑了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The traitor attacked me! He got away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,科巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Koba…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是阴魂不散\N{\fnArial\fs30}still haunts us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前没意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't I see…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类对他的所做所为 他有多么耿耿于怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he could not forgive what humans did to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道他内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one could have known how much darkness…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.91,0:13:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多阴暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was living inside him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家 火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, Rocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.01,0:14:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look tired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.26,0:14:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,路途遥远\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a long journey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 我们有发现！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, we found something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.51,0:14:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.58,0:15:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尼利厄斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cornelius…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.43,0:15:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快和你哥哥打个招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hi to your brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.23,0:15:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 快看这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look who's here, son…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.12,0:15:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lake…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.73,0:16:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it, father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.15,0:16:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以在这里建个新家园 重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can start over… A new home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.53,0:16:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 那些山的另一边是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is beyond those mountains, son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.37,0:16:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们看看 火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show them, Rocket…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.88,0:16:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个沙漠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A desert!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.51,0:16:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,路途很遥远…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The journey is long…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.26,0:16:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以人类不会找上门来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that is why humans will not find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.14,0:17:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须今晚就离开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must leave tonight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.18,0:17:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚？不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight? That's impossible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.69,0:17:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还能躲多久 莱克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long can we wait, Lake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,军队快来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soldiers getting closer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.44,0:17:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,温特…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子这段时间不在 凯撒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son's been gone, Caesar…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不知道我们的生活多艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't know how hard it's been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.08,0:17:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you are scared…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.42,0:17:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们还是需要好好计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we are still planning…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.51,0:17:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找到离开森林的安全路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must find a safe way out of the woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.81,0:17:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前只有你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were only two of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.35,0:17:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们有很多同胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we are… many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.45,0:18:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到路线走出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will find a way out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,猿族要团结起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apes together…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.55,0:18:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.49,0:19:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here, son!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.70,0:19:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护你妈妈和弟弟！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect your mother and brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar! What's wrong?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少人在巡逻？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many on patrol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.59,0:20:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,五六个人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five? Six?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.79,0:20:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,集结起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢卡 叫上火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luca, get Rocket, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.31,0:21:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫指挥部 上校…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lima four to command. Colonel, did you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.70,0:21:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,火箭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocket!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.86,0:21:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.49,0:21:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见他说话了！上校在这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard him talking! The Colonel is here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.58,0:21:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,九十九号 目标已拿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}99, target acquired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.75,0:21:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,九十九号 目标已拿下 重复一遍 金刚已死\N{\fnArial\fs30}99, target acquired. Repeat. King Kong is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.54,0:21:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 我要从这里上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. I can get out from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.92,0:23:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.72,0:23:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找不到温特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't find Winter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.26,0:23:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他之前吓坏了！我觉得他背叛了我们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was scared! I think he betrayed us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.44,0:24:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们找到科尼利厄斯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you found Cornelius yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.86,0:24:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还在找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still searching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.70,0:24:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找凯撒的小儿子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go look for Caesar's little son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.44,0:24:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 科尼利厄斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cornelius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.91,0:25:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're safe now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.81,0:25:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lake…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.06,0:25:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你爱我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You loved my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.44,0:25:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就照顾好他的弟弟 等我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look after his brother until I return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.36,0:25:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不和大家一起去我们的新家吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not coming with us to our new home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.95,0:25:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.66,0:25:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,和莱克一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go with Lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.60,0:26:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.23,0:26:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是要去追他们吧？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going after them?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.27,0:26:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他们 是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not them. Him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.40,0:26:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒 你是我们的首领！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar, you are our leader!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.99,0:26:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能没有首领自己走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't leave without you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.53,0:26:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.16,0:26:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,士兵们很快就会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The soldiers will be back soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.49,0:26:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.00,0:26:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I find him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.67,0:26:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有士兵都会来追我\N{\fnArial\fs30}the soldiers will all come after me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.00,0:26:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你们离开森林的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That may give you the best chance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.84,0:26:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get out of the woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.84,0:26:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去哪？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he going?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.64,0:26:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar! Caesar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.73,0:27:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些士兵的营地总是不固定\N{\fnArial\fs30}The soldiers' camp is always moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.74,0:27:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的卫兵们知道在哪能找到营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guards think they know where it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.11,0:27:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me take you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.66,0:27:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我帮助你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need me to back you up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.62,0:27:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.54,0:27:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.42,0:27:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道失去儿子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it's like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.67,0:27:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to lose a son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.30,0:28:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能回不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may not make it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.22,0:28:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才要一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.26,0:28:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让你可以回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make sure you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.80,0:28:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫兵们觉得那些士兵在这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards think soldiers here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.35,0:28:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里一直点着火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always fires burning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.11,0:29:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.32,0:29:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜索这片区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search the area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.56,0:29:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,先让我把这些放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna put this down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.14,0:30:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一个人在这里干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing out here alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.51,0:30:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他是个逃兵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's a deserter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.26,0:31:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,四处看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.13,0:31:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,能拿的东西都尽量带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take what you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.04,0:33:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something wrong with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.71,0:33:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她不会说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think she can speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.71,0:33:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.78,0:33:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她自己一个人活不下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll die out here alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.61,0:33:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能带她走 毛里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot take her, Maurice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.25,0:34:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.71,0:34:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不能就这么扔下她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I cannot leave her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.82,0:35:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现上校了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find the Colonel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.66,0:35:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.16,0:35:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,温特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.05,0:35:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the Colonel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.90,0:35:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.44,0:35:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.53,0:35:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left this morning…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.99,0:36:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,带走了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…took many men with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.86,0:36:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有更多的士兵要从北方过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}More soldiers are coming down from the North.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.41,0:36:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校要去边境地带\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Colonel is going to meet them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.08,0:36:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}…at the border.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.71,0:36:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么边境？为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What border? Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.71,0:36:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.22,0:36:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们这些剩下的人 明天也要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the rest of us are going tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.85,0:36:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子们认为北方来的那些士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}The donkeys think the soldiers from the North…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.64,0:36:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是来援助军队 彻底铲除掉猿族\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are coming to help finish off the apes for good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.14,0:36:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一天 山上那场战斗结束以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}That day, after the battle on the hill…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.57,0:36:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓到的那个驴子答应我 上校就会饶我一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The donkey we caught promised me the Colonel would spare my life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.32,0:36:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我告诉他们你们藏在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I told them where you were hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.20,0:36:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.12,0:36:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.50,0:36:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}my wife…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.67,0:37:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}are dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.71,0:38:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.50,0:38:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,等士兵们离开的时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait till the soldiers go…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.21,0:38:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着他们找到上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow them to the Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.41,0:38:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,科巴？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Koba!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.71,0:39:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,猿族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ape…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.25,0:39:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不应该杀害猿族\N{\fnArial\fs30}not kill ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.27,0:39:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,士兵们动身了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The soldiers are leaving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.64,0:39:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们停下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.81,0:39:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.49,0:40:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在朝什么开火？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they shooting at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.87,0:40:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.58,0:41:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他们要杀了你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did they shoot you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.68,0:42:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,和她一样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.56,0:42:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会说话！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cannot speak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.27,0:42:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的伤口都是致命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will die of those wounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.58,0:42:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luca…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.06,0:42:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,士兵们都去哪了？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did the soldiers go?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.98,0:42:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,温特说他们去了边境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winter said they were going to a border.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.23,0:42:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但是在哪个方向？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but which way is that?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.59,0:46:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏猿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad Ape!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.22,0:46:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是坏猿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad Ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.73,0:46:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.69,0:47:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.73,0:47:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他看不懂手语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he understands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.49,0:47:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't recognize him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.57,0:47:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.41,0:47:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里只有你一个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you alone here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.06,0:47:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.95,0:47:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.62,0:48:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到女孩 以为你们是一帮人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see girl, I think you human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.79,0:48:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们是猿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.92,0:48:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我一样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.13,0:48:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别动 放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, put down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.47,0:48:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里待了多久了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.97,0:48:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.43,0:48:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long, long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.61,0:48:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.20,0:48:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.20,0:48:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有同伴吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there more like you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.83,0:48:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,动物园里的其他猿呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}More apes from zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.83,0:48:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了 全都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead. All dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.04,0:48:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.84,0:48:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类生病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human get sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.67,0:48:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,猿变聪明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ape get smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.01,0:48:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后人类杀猿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then human kill ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.14,0:48:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没有被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.97,0:48:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.18,0:49:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自学了开口说话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You learn to speak…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.52,0:49:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听人类说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. Human…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.52,0:49:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,“坏猿！”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Bad Ape!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.32,0:49:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏猿 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad Ape. Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.70,0:49:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.53,0:49:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}No touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.54,0:49:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.67,0:49:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.89,0:49:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可思议…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.89,0:49:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直以为我们是唯一的一群\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always thought we were the only ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.39,0:49:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还好奇 世界上还有更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonder if there are more in the world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.15,0:49:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我们这样的猿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}More apes like us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.23,0:49:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 吃啊 吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat! Eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.45,0:49:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有新朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}New friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.41,0:49:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是特殊的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.41,0:50:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪里搞到这个的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.75,0:50:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.25,0:50:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前我发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.80,0:50:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开动物园后我去觅食\N{\fnArial\fs30}After zoo, I look for food…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.55,0:50:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到这个人类动物园\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find human zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.72,0:50:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,专门关病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoo for sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.43,0:50:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,高高的墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.06,0:50:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,生病的人类爬墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick human climb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.10,0:50:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏的人类杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad human kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.23,0:50:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来所有人类都病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, all get sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.57,0:50:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,都死光了 好久好久\N{\fnArial\fs30}All dead now for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.45,0:50:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.61,0:50:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏的人类？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad humans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.95,0:50:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,士兵吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soldiers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.08,0:50:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.79,0:50:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个废弃的军事营地！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A deserted military camp!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.83,0:50:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在边境上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the border!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.84,0:50:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许上校带着军队就是要去那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the Colonel and the troops are going there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.97,0:50:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里远吗 你能带我们去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it far? Can you take us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.14,0:51:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类动物园？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human zoo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.10,0:51:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！别去那里 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no go back there. I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.93,0:51:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都死了 我到这里来 这里很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone dead. I come here. Very safe here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.31,0:51:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不回去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.65,0:51:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 你必须带我们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, you must take us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.31,0:51:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！我不带\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! Cannot take!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.94,0:51:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不带 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cannot take. No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.11,0:51:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊 看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.49,0:51:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,又下雪了 没法离开 必须留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}More snow. Cannot go. Must stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.32,0:51:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以吃东西 休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You eat, you rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.45,0:51:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来 跟我一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.54,0:51:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 这个归你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, you keep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.67,0:51:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,归她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She keep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.03,0:52:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.41,0:52:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.88,0:52:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.71,0:52:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她是和你们一起的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.59,0:52:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她无依无靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has no one else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.18,0:52:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你刚刚看她的眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you look at her just now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.86,0:52:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.95,0:52:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有孩子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.25,0:52:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.08,0:52:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个被人类杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other was killed by human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.21,0:52:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,士兵吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soldier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.61,0:53:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有过孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.78,0:53:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你能在人类动物园…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you will find him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.95,0:53:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}at human zoo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.92,0:53:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个士兵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}With soldier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.84,0:53:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.97,0:53:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.81,0:53:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.19,0:54:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我可以带你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe I take you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.42,0:55:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,渴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirsty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.76,0:55:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她渴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirsty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.64,0:55:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我渴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirsty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.78,0:56:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢卡 跟我来 我们走近点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luca, come. Let's go closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.74,0:56:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留下保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep them safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.33,0:56:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.29,0:56:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.75,0:56:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边呢？是巡逻队吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that? A patrol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.30,0:56:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see riders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.14,0:56:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.31,0:56:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现他们朝这边来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw them coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.18,0:57:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少这次…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least this time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.01,0:57:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保护了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was able to protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.25,0:58:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.09,0:58:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能继续了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This must stop…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.47,0:58:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在去加入其它猿的大部队还不迟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not too late to join the other apes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.60,0:58:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能回头！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot turn back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.10,0:58:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢卡献出了他的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luca gave his life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.31,0:58:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.11,0:58:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们必须付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.99,0:59:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.83,0:59:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去就像科巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you sound like Koba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.09,0:59:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你们来是个错误的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a mistake bringing you all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.30,0:59:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我一个人的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.09,0:59:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会独自完成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will finish this alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.35,0:59:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.51,0:59:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.43,0:59:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,去加入大部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.60,1:00:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.40,1:01:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们突然出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came out of nowhere…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.57,1:01:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,袭击了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attacked us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.62,1:01:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以为他们会将我们全部杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought they would kill us all…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.95,1:01:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是上校阻止了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Colonel stopped them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.25,1:01:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的眼神里流露着疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was madness in his eyes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.04,1:01:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说要在我们死之前好好利用我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said they would use us, before we died!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.59,1:01:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们就把我们都带到这儿来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they brought us all here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.59,1:01:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用你们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.93,1:01:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们逼迫我们干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been forcing us to work!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.10,1:01:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.94,1:01:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们干什么样的活？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.57,1:01:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.90,1:01:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小儿子 他怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My little son. Is he here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.00,1:01:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰特 李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grant and Lee…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.13,1:02:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,惠林顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wellington…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.80,1:02:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,和拿破仑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Napoleon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.14,1:02:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Custer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.64,1:02:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有卧牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Sitting Bull…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.27,1:02:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能没看过什么书\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're probably not much of a reader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.15,1:02:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是一个伟大的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is a big moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.49,1:02:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你躲哪儿去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.32,1:02:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完全是偶遇到了你的族群 真幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came upon your herd. We got lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.66,1:02:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很惊讶 你居然没跟他们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was surprised you weren't with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.66,1:02:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.88,1:02:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿你不会后悔放了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you don't come to regret sparing his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.72,1:02:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个优秀的射手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's quite a good shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.69,1:03:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最终还是来救你的族人了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you finally come to save your apes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.69,1:03:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.03,1:03:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,找我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.53,1:03:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天晚上我杀的是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did I kill that night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.91,1:03:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.00,1:03:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.05,1:03:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.39,1:03:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来是想杀你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.07,1:03:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.61,1:03:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.40,1:03:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直跟人类的眼睛一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.41,1:03:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么找到这儿的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know I was here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.62,1:03:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收到消息 你会来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was told you were coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.88,1:04:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,北方的大部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}That more soldiers from the North…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.92,1:04:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,会来这儿和你汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}would be joining you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.05,1:04:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我汇合？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joining me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.30,1:04:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了把我们猿类\N{\fnArial\fs30}To finish us off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.55,1:04:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶尽杀绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}For good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.72,1:04:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁告诉你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who told you that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.82,1:04:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.45,1:04:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.49,1:05:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.49,1:05:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.03,1:06:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lake…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.24,1:06:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.41,1:06:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们经历太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been through much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.09,1:06:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.13,1:06:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have I done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.38,1:07:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体 立定！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Battalion, halt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.64,1:07:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲜血！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.85,1:07:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,滋养青草！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes the grass grow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.81,1:07:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.89,1:07:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以献出鲜血！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the blood flow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.60,1:07:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们既是开始！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the beginning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.98,1:07:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是终结！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the end!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.92,1:09:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我们来了这儿 还没得到水和食物…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't had food or water since we got here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.43,1:09:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么要建这堵墙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do they need a wall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.03,1:10:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.11,1:10:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.50,1:10:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.42,1:10:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donkey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.72,1:10:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,教训他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.93,1:10:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, okay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.67,1:10:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再打了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.28,1:13:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们回去继续工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them to get back to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.62,1:13:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要食物和水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apes need food and water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.79,1:13:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.34,1:13:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give them food…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.46,1:13:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,和水\N{\fnArial\fs30}and water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.01,1:14:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,五\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.39,1:14:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.98,1:14:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.06,1:14:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.17,1:14:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回去工作！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! Back to work!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.90,1:14:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他绑起来 驴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}String him up, donkey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.49,1:15:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.16,1:15:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很坏 很坏的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad, bad place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.83,1:15:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.59,1:15:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must save them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.84,1:15:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么救？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.05,1:15:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,动动脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must think!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.47,1:15:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒他会怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would Caesar do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.06,1:15:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.94,1:15:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么这么小？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why so small?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.78,1:15:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.51,1:16:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校承诺了你什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did the Colonel promise you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.35,1:16:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为他会放过你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think he'll let you live…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.23,1:16:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们都死了之后？\N{\fnArial\fs30}after we are gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.15,1:16:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让他们叫你驴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let them call you "donkey."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.11,1:16:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你是猿类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.04,1:16:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kerna want see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.31,1:16:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,再敢妨碍他们干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interfere with the work again…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.90,1:16:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就把他们一个个全都杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll begin slaughtering the apes one by one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.15,1:17:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,听懂了吗？我需要那堵墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand? I need that wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.32,1:17:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要食物和水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apes need food and water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.12,1:17:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,当任务完成后 我自然会给他们食物和水\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll get food and water when they finish their work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.16,1:17:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们食物和水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give apes food and water…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.29,1:17:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则任务没法完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}or they cannot finish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.08,1:17:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太感情用事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you are very emotional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.67,1:17:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么资本跟我讨价还价？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think you're in a position to make demands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.81,1:17:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.14,1:17:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部队快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The soldiers who are coming here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.06,1:17:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是来和你汇合的 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}they are not coming to join you, are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.69,1:17:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到外面那些士兵 在墙上准备作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw men outside on the wall, preparing for battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.07,1:17:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们告诉我你很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me you were smart…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.78,1:17:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过想不到这么聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.91,1:17:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.87,1:17:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是来汇合的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't be joining me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.12,1:17:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是你的敌人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are against you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.83,1:17:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们害怕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They fear me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.46,1:17:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.63,1:18:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你连自己人也杀吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you kill your own men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.21,1:18:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现了尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.88,1:18:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something wrong…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.97,1:18:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}with these men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.47,1:18:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 你真是让我大开眼界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ, you are impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.39,1:18:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 据你所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you paint quite a picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.86,1:18:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定觉得我不是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you must think of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.23,1:18:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你没有怜悯之心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you have no mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.84,1:18:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可是来杀我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came here to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.92,1:18:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你会对我有怜悯之心吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you gonna show me mercy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.30,1:18:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放了你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I showed you mercy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.55,1:18:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的怜悯之心\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I spared your men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.89,1:18:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提出了和平共处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I offered you peace…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.48,1:18:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你却杀了我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you killed my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.20,1:19:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.59,1:19:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你的怜悯会让我们陷入怎样的境地吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any idea what your mercy would do to us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.04,1:19:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们比我们强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're much stronger than we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.00,1:19:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还那么聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're smart as hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.17,1:19:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你怎么说 你们终将取代我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what you say, you'd eventually replace us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.22,1:19:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是自然的法则\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the law of nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.97,1:19:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,讽刺的是 是我们创造了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The irony is, we created you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.39,1:19:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总是试着违背自然 征服自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tried to defy nature, bend it to our will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.39,1:19:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是大自然开始惩罚我们的自以为是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nature has been punishing us for our arrogance… ever since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.78,1:19:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,十个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 months ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.99,1:19:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我派出了侦查小组去寻找你们的基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent out recon units to look for your base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.32,1:19:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子就是这个小组的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own son was a soldier with one of the units.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.62,1:19:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天他突然不能说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day he suddenly stopped speaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.20,1:19:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变得原始化 像动物一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He became primitive, like an animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.08,1:19:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They contacted me and said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.50,1:19:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,说他们觉得我儿子疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they thought he'd lost his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.46,1:20:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为承受不住战争的压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the war was too much for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.63,1:20:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来负责照顾他的那个人也不会说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the man who cared for him stopped speaking too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.05,1:20:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在小队的医务兵还能说话的时候 他提出了一个理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their medic had a theory, before he stopped speaking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.76,1:20:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是幸存者身上也同样携带着\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the virus that almost wiped us out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.93,1:20:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那让人类濒临灭绝的可怕病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}the virus that every human survivor still carries…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.64,1:20:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒突变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}had suddenly changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.98,1:20:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,变异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mutated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.98,1:20:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它转播开来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that if it spread…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.32,1:20:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类将会彻底灭亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would destroy humanity for good this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.74,1:20:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是杀死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not by killing us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.24,1:20:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是会夺走我们之所以成为人类的核心\N{\fnArial\fs30}but by robbing us of those things that make us human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.83,1:20:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的语言 我们的高等思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our speech, our higher thinking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.50,1:20:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会把我们变成野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would turn us into beasts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.71,1:20:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却在这儿跟我谈怜悯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk about mercy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.92,1:20:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,换作你你会怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you have done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.80,1:20:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时有那么一刻我非常清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a moment of clarity for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.93,1:20:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realized…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.26,1:20:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须牺牲自己唯一的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I would have to sacrifice my only son…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.48,1:21:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样人类才能得以保全\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that humanity could be saved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.07,1:21:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我握着那把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I held that gun in my hand…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.23,1:21:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,良久\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.07,1:21:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它对着我唯一的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pointed it at my only child…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.58,1:21:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}he looked at me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.83,1:21:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼神里全是信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}trust in his eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.67,1:21:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使在他原始的眼神中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even in his primitive gaze…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.89,1:21:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也感受到了他的… 爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt his… love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.36,1:21:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扣动了扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled the trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.69,1:21:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉被净化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It purified me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.99,1:21:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这使我的目标更加明确\N{\fnArial\fs30}It made my purpose clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.16,1:22:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下令杀掉其他被感染的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave the orders to kill the other infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.04,1:22:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.37,1:22:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn their belongings…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.83,1:22:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何能够传播病毒的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and anything that might spread contamination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.29,1:22:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些手下质疑我的判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of the men questioned my judgment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.05,1:22:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在让他们去做和我一样的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was asking them to do what I had done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.84,1:22:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲他们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sacrifice their friends…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.34,1:22:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}their family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.64,1:22:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 他们拒绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, they refused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.48,1:22:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我把他们也杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I had them killed too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.65,1:22:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他带着孩子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others with children…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.19,1:22:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷偷逃进了树林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}deserted into the woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.32,1:22:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个懦夫 跑到了北方我的上级那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of those cowards fled to my superiors up North.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.58,1:22:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们试图说服我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tried to convince me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.08,1:22:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我相信这场瘟疫可以通过医疗手段来解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}this plague could be dealt with medically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.58,1:22:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意识到 在经历了这么多之后他们还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when I realized that they had learned nothing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.09,1:22:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没学到\N{\fnArial\fs30}from our past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.80,1:22:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他们也杀了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed them too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.76,1:22:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是怎么做的来着 普里彻？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I do, Preacher?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.85,1:23:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你砍下了他们的脑袋 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You severed their heads, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.93,1:23:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了被我放走的那一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for the one I spared…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.31,1:23:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让他回去替我捎个口信\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that he could return, and deliver a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.15,1:23:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们想要卸下我的指挥权\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they wanted to relieve me of my command…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.77,1:23:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得来这里找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}they would have to meet me here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.78,1:23:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲自动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and do it themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.90,1:23:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里曾经是个军械库\N{\fnArial\fs30}This used to be a weapons depot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.45,1:23:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把这里改造成了一个集中营\N{\fnArial\fs30}They turned it into a relocation camp{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.74,1:23:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在猿流感爆发初期\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the crisis was just beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.70,1:23:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是武器还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the weapons are still here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.54,1:23:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在山里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}inside the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.17,1:23:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会派\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many men…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.83,1:23:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少人来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.63,1:23:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会倾巢出动 但别想太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably all of them. But don't get any ideas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.96,1:23:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我 他们最怕的就是你们猿类了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing they fear more than me is you apes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.27,1:23:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一场圣战\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is… a holy war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.77,1:23:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人类历史都指向这一时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of human history has led to this moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.44,1:23:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we lose…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.03,1:24:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将成为最后的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll be the last of our kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.57,1:24:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的地球会成为你们的猩球\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be a planet of apes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.74,1:24:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们也会成为你们的牲口\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will become your cattle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.83,1:24:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.21,1:24:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我疯了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm sick, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.05,1:24:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实并不想杀你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to kill your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.68,1:24:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果他注定会继承你的王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if his destiny was to inherit your unholy kingdom…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.40,1:24:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我很欣慰我杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad I did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.48,1:24:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.61,1:24:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来！驴子 抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back! Donkey, hold him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.74,1:24:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.16,1:24:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么感情用事！\N{\fnArial\fs30}So emotional!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.21,1:24:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你内心非常纠结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see how conflicted you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.67,1:25:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞不清楚自己的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're confused in your purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.18,1:25:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我的所作所为感到愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are angry at me for something I did{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.51,1:25:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这就是残酷的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was an act of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.22,1:25:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在你已经对此注入了太多的私人恩怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're taking this all much too personally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.94,1:25:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.23,1:25:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你杀了我 我的人会怎么处置你的同类？\N{\fnArial\fs30}my men would have done to your apes if you had killed me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.03,1:25:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说杀了我对你来说更重要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is killing me more important?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.21,1:25:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soldiers everywhere!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.17,1:25:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么进去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will we get in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.05,1:25:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,得想办法进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must get in somehow…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.43,1:25:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须得进去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must get in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.77,1:25:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去？要进去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In? In?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.06,1:25:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.60,1:25:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能进去！不能！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No go in! No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.28,1:26:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 朋友！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends, friends!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.07,1:26:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能进去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no go in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.74,1:26:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能进去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No go in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.87,1:26:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友！朋友！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friend! Friend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.09,1:26:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.97,1:27:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我们的命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved our lives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.47,1:27:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,患病的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick humans…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.89,1:27:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定就是从这里逃走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…must have escaped down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.36,1:28:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.32,1:28:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别爬！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No climb!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.75,1:28:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.08,1:28:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.84,1:28:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonder where we are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.62,1:28:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, friend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.75,1:29:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.21,1:29:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.58,1:29:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.75,1:29:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.63,1:29:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！回来 回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Come! Come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.89,1:29:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来！回来 回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come! Come back! Come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.10,1:29:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.98,1:29:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来！回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come! Come! Come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.26,1:29:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,科巴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Koba!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.93,1:30:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.31,1:30:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救不了他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot save them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.81,1:30:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,猿类都将死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apes all die here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.32,1:30:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.82,1:30:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.99,1:30:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.64,1:30:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果明早他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's still alive in the morning…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.64,1:30:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让他回去和其他猿类一起干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}he goes to work like everyone else…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.48,1:30:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you shoot him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.65,1:30:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 快来 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come! Come, come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.03,1:30:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她进去了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She go in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.56,1:32:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,渴吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirsty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.24,1:34:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.95,1:34:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.25,1:34:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人类会杀了她的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans will kill her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.80,1:34:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么做 你们快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what to do! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.06,1:34:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,举手 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arms up! Hey! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.44,1:34:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 举手 - 小心 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Arms up! - Watch it! Watch it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.65,1:35:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.78,1:35:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep 'em up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.39,1:36:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他猿类在这吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there others out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.03,1:36:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,去搜查下附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweep the area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.53,1:36:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他押到围栏里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him in the pen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.28,1:37:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好点了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeling better?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.04,1:37:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.13,1:37:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们可以谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we can talk about…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.63,1:37:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃跑的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.09,1:37:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,猩猩团结力量大！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apes together strong!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.23,1:37:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们既是开始！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the beginning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.60,1:37:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,亦是终结！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the end!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.63,1:38:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还活着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.91,1:38:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,派他去采石场 就他一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send him to the quarry. Alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.25,1:38:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.52,1:39:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.11,1:39:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西怎么到这的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did this get in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.03,1:39:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他去干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.05,1:39:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,37\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty-seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.43,1:39:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,55\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty-five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.02,1:39:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,走37步到大部队的笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty-seven steps to the adult cage…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.65,1:39:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,55步到孩子们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty-five to the children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.69,1:40:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.56,1:40:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到墙建好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kerna shoot apes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.90,1:40:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校就会杀了所有猿类\N{\fnArial\fs30}when war is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.11,1:40:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这墙是疯狂之举\N{\fnArial\fs30}His war is madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.28,1:40:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本救不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't save him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.62,1:40:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像它也救不了你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}any more than it will save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.96,1:40:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己会救我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I save myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.96,1:40:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己还剩什么值得去救的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything left of you to save?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.40,1:41:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.21,1:41:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙都回笼子里了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apes going back to the cage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.72,1:41:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.85,1:41:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are very brave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.48,1:41:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.89,1:41:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.73,1:41:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.19,1:42:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,猿类？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ape?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.70,1:42:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.99,1:42:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是猿类吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ape?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.37,1:42:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.14,1:42:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nova.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.23,1:42:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nova.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.74,1:42:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 来 快过来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come! Come! Come see!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.91,1:42:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come see!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.91,1:42:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 快来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come! Come see!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.38,1:43:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,34，35，36，37！\N{\fnArial\fs30}34, 35, 36, 37…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.46,1:43:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,30\N{\fnArial\fs30}30.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.52,1:43:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,37！\N{\fnArial\fs30}37!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.68,1:43:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.94,1:43:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.41,1:43:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.79,1:43:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.46,1:43:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.63,1:43:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.09,1:43:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.76,1:43:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.03,1:44:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我跟你们说的那个同类！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the ape I told you about!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.71,1:45:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.56,1:45:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏猿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad Ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.09,1:45:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是坏猿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad Ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.69,1:45:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏 坏猿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad. Bad Ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.93,1:45:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.71,1:45:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.60,1:46:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能再挖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't keep digging!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.06,1:46:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然整个隧道都会被淹了的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will flood the whole tunnel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.48,1:46:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是不继续的话 我们就够不到孩子们了啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't, we can't reach the children!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.96,1:46:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须继续在这下面找路子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must keep looking down there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.96,1:46:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再想想其他办法去孩子们那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find another way to reach the children…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.17,1:46:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在必须马上离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must leave now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.22,1:46:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,更多士兵就要来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}More soldiers are coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.09,1:46:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类要自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans will destroy each other!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.05,1:46:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会殃及我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And us with them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.60,1:46:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在只能在地面上救孩子们出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to get the children out above ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.31,1:46:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么救？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.60,1:47:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.10,1:47:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些畜生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You animals!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.87,1:47:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁干的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.13,1:47:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁干的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.21,1:47:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.05,1:47:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.39,1:48:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.42,1:49:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.74,1:51:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.43,1:51:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.77,1:51:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar, what's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.24,1:51:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 你赶紧走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, you must go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.95,1:51:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你不走吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.41,1:51:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.20,1:51:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,毛里斯说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maurice was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.79,1:52:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.42,1:52:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像科巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}like Koba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.76,1:52:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他那时\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.05,1:52:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,放不下仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}escape his hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.98,1:52:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我也无法放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I still cannot escape mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.78,1:52:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走 快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.74,1:52:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.12,1:53:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校！上校！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel! Colonel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.87,1:53:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他人到底在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.03,1:53:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 趴下 趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down! Down! Down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.91,1:53:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.96,1:58:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,击落它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.14,1:58:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！驴子 装弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, donkey. Let's go! Reload!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.80,1:59:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 你在里面吗 上校？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, are you in there? Colonel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.97,1:59:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它打破\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just break it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.59,1:59:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donkey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.35,1:59:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去拿榴弹发射器！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grenade launcher!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.95,2:00:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 驴子 把发射器给我拿来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it, donkey! Get me the launcher!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.03,2:05:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:04.24,2:05:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:11.74,2:09:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.00,2:09:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,毛里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maurice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.25,2:09:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们现在都到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are all home now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:31.59,2:09:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,猿类很强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apes are strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.85,2:09:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}With…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.35,2:09:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}or without me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.34,2:10:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.55,2:10:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}will know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.01,2:10:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}who…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.64,2:10:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.35,2:10:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.66,2:10:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.41,2:10:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.08,2:10:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}did…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:45.83,2:10:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:53.11,2:11:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar…{\r}
